    },
    {
      "id": "text-148",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1769,
      "y": 2198.75,
      "width": 476.5469665527344,
      "height": 202.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1120102813,
      "version": 6,
      "versionNonce": 265122080,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793504932510,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "RERANKING\n\nThe first stage is fast and wide, for example the top\n50 results. A cross-encoder then reads the query and\neach candidate together. It is more accurate but\nslower, so it only runs on this short list. Keep the\nbest few, such as the top 5, for the LLM. This gives\nbetter evidence and uses fewer tokens, but adds\nlatency, so measure whether it is worth it.",
      "originalText": "RERANKING\n\nThe first stage is fast and wide, for example the top\n50 results. A cross-encoder then reads the query and\neach candidate together. It is more accurate but\nslower, so it only runs on this short list. Keep the\nbest few, such as the top 5, for the LLM. This gives\nbetter evidence and uses fewer tokens, but adds\nlatency, so measure whether it is worth it.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "rectangle-147",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b1N",
      "labelPosition": 0.5,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "rectangle-149",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 2500,
      "width": 547,
      "height": 340,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6741d9",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 924342700,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 29692745,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "text-150"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1793462357368,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b1O"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-150",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 35,
      "y": 2557.5,
      "width": 493.5208740234375,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 365698900,
      "version": 6,
      "versionNonce": 1396854048,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793504932510,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "TOOL CALLING AND AGENTS\n\nThe model never runs anything itself. It returns a\ntool name and JSON arguments, your backend validates\nand runs the tool, and the result goes back to the\nmodel. Repeating this loop is what makes an agent. MCP\nis an open standard for connecting tools to models.\nUse tools for live stock and cart actions, and ask a\nhuman to approve actions that matter, like placing an\norder.",
      "originalText": "TOOL CALLING AND AGENTS\n\nThe model never runs anything itself. It returns a\ntool name and JSON arguments, your backend validates\nand runs the tool, and the result goes back to the\nmodel. Repeating this loop is what makes an agent. MCP\nis an open standard for connecting tools to models.\nUse tools for live stock and cart actions, and ask a\nhuman to approve actions that matter, like placing an\norder.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "rectangle-149",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b1P",
      "labelPosition": 0.5,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "rectangle-151",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 608,
      "y": 2500,
      "width": 547,
      "height": 340,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6741d9",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 851536356,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1748353577,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "text-152"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1793462357368,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b1Q"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-152",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 613,
      "y": 2568.75,
      "width": 503.04278564453125,
      "height": 202.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 386835918,
      "version": 6,
      "versionNonce": 196847904,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793504932510,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "STRUCTURED OUTPUT\n\nApps need data, not paragraphs. Ask the model for JSON\nthat fits a schema, such as product, quantity and\nunit. Validate it with a library like Zod, then retry\nor fall back if it fails. Valid format does not mean\ncorrect content: \"aadha kilo aata\" should become 0.5\nkg of atta, and the product must still be checked\nagainst your real catalogue.",
      "originalText": "STRUCTURED OUTPUT\n\nApps need data, not paragraphs. Ask the model for JSON\nthat fits a schema, such as product, quantity and\nunit. Validate it with a library like Zod, then retry\nor fall back if it fails. Valid format does not mean\ncorrect content: \"aadha kilo aata\" should become 0.5\nkg of atta, and the product must still be checked\nagainst your real catalogue.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "rectangle-151",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b1R",
      "labelPosition": 0.5,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "rectangle-153",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1186,
      "y": 2500,
      "width": 547,
      "height": 340,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6741d9",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 518984632,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1584239881,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "text-154"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1793462357368,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b1S"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-154",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1191,
      "y": 2568.75,
      "width": 468.447021484375,
      "height": 202.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1356702802,
      "version": 6,
      "versionNonce": 615089440,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793504932510,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "STREAMING AND RELIABILITY\n\nLLM calls can take seconds, so stream the words to\nkeep the screen alive. Set timeouts and retries, rate-\nlimit each user, and cache repeated queries to cut\ncost. Slow or expensive work belongs in background\njobs. Plan for the provider being down by falling back\nto plain search. Log latency, tokens and cost for\nevery request so problems are visible.",
      "originalText": "STREAMING AND RELIABILITY\n\nLLM calls can take seconds, so stream the words to\nkeep the screen alive. Set timeouts and retries, rate-\nlimit each user, and cache repeated queries to cut\ncost. Slow or expensive work belongs in background\njobs. Plan for the provider being down by falling back\nto plain search. Log latency, tokens and cost for\nevery request so problems are visible.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "rectangle-153",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b1T",
      "labelPosition": 0.5,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "rectangle-155",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1764,
      "y": 2500,
      "width": 547,
      "height": 340,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6741d9",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 1856204099,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 669518825,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "text-156"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1793462357368,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b1U"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-156",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1769,
      "y": 2568.75,
      "width": 468.71710205078125,
      "height": 202.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 194656651,
      "version": 6,
      "versionNonce": 461103392,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793504932510,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SECURITY AND EVALUATION\n\nPrompt injection: user text or retrieved text may\ncontain instructions, so treat it as data. Limit tool\npermissions, and enforce shop isolation in the\ndatabase, not in the prompt. To evaluate, build a\nlabelled test set of real queries. Track Recall@k and\nMRR for retrieval, and check answers are grounded in\nthe evidence. Re-run the tests after every change.",
      "originalText": "SECURITY AND EVALUATION\n\nPrompt injection: user text or retrieved text may\ncontain instructions, so treat it as data. Limit tool\npermissions, and enforce shop isolation in the\ndatabase, not in the prompt. To evaluate, build a\nlabelled test set of real queries. Track Recall@k and\nMRR for retrieval, and check answers are grounded in\nthe evidence. Re-run the tests after every change.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "rectangle-155",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b1V",
      "labelPosition": 0.5,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
